    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158750/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1746739760\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158750/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1746739760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158750/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1746739760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Survive the invasion of endless hordes of monsters together with friends online! Level up, acquire new powers and overcome the bosses to in this cooperative action roguelike!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLAY ONLINE WITH FRIENDS</h2>Create a room to join with up to three friends online (or join a public room) to collaborate and survive together in this adventure. Local coop is also supported.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNIQUE BUILDS</h2>Select different upgrades and discover unique builds for each character and each match.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EACH MAGE HAS UNIQUE SPELLS</h2>Every mage has unique attributes, spells and a very different playstyle. Test different combinations with you friends to make the best party configurations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FIGHT DIFFERENT BOSSES</h2>Encounter different Bosses and Minibosses during each run, having to adapt and find the best ways to defeat them.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MYSTERIES AWAIT</h2>Leave no stone unturned to find secret bosses, areas and unlockable characters.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158750/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1746739760\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158750/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1746739760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158750/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1746739760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Survive the invasion of endless hordes of monsters together with friends online! Level up, acquire new powers and overcome the bosses to in this cooperative action roguelike!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLAY ONLINE WITH FRIENDS</h2>Create a room to join with up to three friends online (or join a public room) to collaborate and survive together in this adventure. Local coop is also supported.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNIQUE BUILDS</h2>Select different upgrades and discover unique builds for each character and each match.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EACH MAGE HAS UNIQUE SPELLS</h2>Every mage has unique attributes, spells and a very different playstyle. Test different combinations with you friends to make the best party configurations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FIGHT DIFFERENT BOSSES</h2>Encounter different Bosses and Minibosses during each run, having to adapt and find the best ways to defeat them.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MYSTERIES AWAIT</h2>Leave no stone unturned to find secret bosses, areas and unlockable characters.",
    "short_description": "Join friends online to survive endless hordes of monsters in this online coop &quot;survivors&quot; game! Evolve your spells, defeat bosses and develop the best character builds and party formations. Cooperation is key to survive in this action roguelike with unique characters.",
